  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  Title: Exhibit VII - The Museum Charter
  Body: 'By deed of the Morvayne family, 1803.


    The family shall provide the
    collection. The Curator shall keep it, and keep it fed.


    The collection
    shall never leave the house. Neither shall the family.


    Nothing is to be
    taken below the house, and nothing below the house is to be


    The rest of
    the page has been torn away.'
  ReadClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d827ef23d1b788f4b92b1131a21aa803, type: 3}
  Verb: Read
